#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:1
msgid "辅助机设定"
msgstr "Support Machine Settings"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:3
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;辅助机是一种悬浮、履带、双足或是四足机器人。用于收集地面采集的能源物质——由变异植物吸收太阳辐射生长出的特殊伪花。并通过携带的装置转换成可以抵抗恶劣气候的能量防护罩，并以物理护盾保护地面行动小队，分担怪物造成的攻击伤害。另外辅助机也负责帮助行动队员携带各式战斗装备。辅助机无战斗能力，实际体型通常有1.2人高，通过基础的AI程序对战斗支持对象进行跟随，为了不遮挡行动队员的视线，自身会启动光学迷彩隐藏大部分的身体部件，只显示少部分部件用于视觉定位和互动。在辅助机能源耗尽后会关闭光学迷彩，并停止行动，任由敌方单位进行攻击。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Support machines are hovering, tracked, bipedal, or "
"quadrupedal robots. They are used to collect energy substances gathered "
"from the surface — special pseudo-flowers grown by mutant plants "
"absorbing solar radiation. Through their carried devices, these are "
"converted into energy shields that can withstand harsh climates, and they"
" protect ground action teams with physical shields, absorbing attack "
"damage from monsters. Support machines are also responsible for helping "
"action team members carry various combat equipment. Support machines have"
" no combat capability. Their actual size is typically about 1.2 times a "
"person's height. They follow their combat support target through a basic "
"AI program. To avoid blocking the view of action team members, they "
"activate optical camouflage to hide most of their body components, "
"displaying only a few parts for visual positioning and interaction. When "
"a support machine runs out of energy, it deactivates its optical "
"camouflage and stops moving, leaving it vulnerable to enemy attacks."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:5
msgid "辅助机外型设定"
msgstr "Support Machine Appearance Design"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:7
msgid "偏向蒸气朋克风，外观没有那么精致和高科技的偏工业感的结构（极端恶劣的自然环境下，偏简洁和直接的机械设计才更耐操）。"
msgstr ""
"Leaning towards a steampunk style, with a less refined and less high-tech"
" industrial-looking structure (in extreme and harsh natural environments,"
" simpler and more direct mechanical designs are more durable)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:8
msgid "有比较明显的展示收集能源的指示槽（比如发光的柱形刻度尺，或是百分比计数的数码屏（类电子表或是像素点阵））。"
msgstr ""
"Has a relatively prominent energy collection indicator slot (such as a "
"glowing columnar scale, or a digital screen with percentage counting "
"(like an electronic watch or pixel dot matrix))."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:9
msgid "有能源物质的收集、存储装置，以及武器装备携带挂载的装置（可以是外挂武器，或是道具装备的收纳箱）。"
msgstr ""
"Has devices for collecting and storing energy substances, as well as "
"weapon and equipment carrying and mounting devices (which can be external"
" weapons or storage boxes for props and equipment)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:10
msgid "开启光学迷彩后露出的部件可以是偏可爱的造型（比如几何体 + 像素点阵的可变“人脸”）。"
msgstr ""
"The components revealed after activating optical camouflage can have a "
"cute design (such as a variable \"face\" made of geometric shapes + pixel"
" dot matrix)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:11
msgid "有能量护罩的发生装置，可以是："
msgstr "Has an energy shield generator, which can be:"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:12
msgid "生成覆盖到机器人身体表面的护罩，然后由机器人移动到队员身前抵挡伤害。"
msgstr ""
"A shield that covers the robot's body surface, then the robot moves in "
"front of team members to block damage."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:13
msgid "如果是人形的机器人，也可以考虑手杖形的发生装置，生成伞型的能量护罩遮挡在队员身前。"
msgstr ""
"For humanoid robots, a cane-shaped generator device could be considered, "
"producing an umbrella-type energy shield to cover team members from the "
"front."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:14
msgid "安装在机器人顶部，生成区域型的护罩。"
msgstr "Installed on top of the robot, generating an area-type shield."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:16
msgid "已有的辅助机设计"
msgstr "Existing Support Machine Designs"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:18
msgid "防御增强型   &emsp;&emsp;增加装甲类的外观设计，增大了能源存储的装置体积。"
msgstr ""
"Defense-Enhanced Type   &emsp;&emsp;Features additional armor-like "
"appearance design with an enlarged energy storage device volume."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:22
msgid "防御增强型"
msgstr "Defense-Enhanced Type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:26
msgid "防御增强型辅助机器人（by：周大西）"
msgstr "Defense-Enhanced Support Robot (by: Zhou Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:29
msgid "攻击增强型   &emsp;&emsp;增加武器和道具携带的空间，缩减能源存储装置的体积。"
msgstr ""
"Attack-Enhanced Type   &emsp;&emsp;Features increased space for carrying "
"weapons and props, with a reduced energy storage device volume."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:33
msgid "攻击增强型"
msgstr "Attack-Enhanced Type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:37
msgid "攻击增强型辅助机器人（by：周大西）"
msgstr "Attack-Enhanced Support Robot (by: Zhou Daxi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:40
msgid "移动增强型   &emsp;&emsp;缩减武器和道具携带的空间以及能源存储装置的体积，使用更加体现移动性能的外观。"
msgstr ""
"Mobility-Enhanced Type   &emsp;&emsp;Features reduced space for carrying "
"weapons and props as well as reduced energy storage device volume, with "
"an appearance that better emphasizes mobility performance."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:44
msgid "移动增强型"
msgstr "Mobility-Enhanced Type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/machine.md:48
msgid "移动增强型辅助机器人（by：周大西）"
msgstr "Mobility-Enhanced Support Robot (by: Zhou Daxi)"

